{"page":14,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:89","surah":2,"ayah":89,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا جَآءَهُمْ كِتَـٰبٌ مِّنْ عِندِ ٱللَّهِ مُصَدِّقٌ لِّمَا مَعَهُمْ وَكَانُوا۟ مِن قَبْلُ يَسْتَفْتِحُونَ عَلَى ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ فَلَمَّا جَآءَهُم مَّا عَرَفُوا۟ كَفَرُوا۟ بِهِۦ ۚ فَلَعْنَةُ ٱللَّهِ عَلَى ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When a Scripture came to them from God confirming what they already had, and when they had been praying for victory against the disbelievers, even when there came to them something they knew [to be true], they disbelieved in it: God rejects those who disbelieve.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"walammā","verse_key":"2:89"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَآءَهُمْ","en_gloss":"came to them","transliteration":"jāahum","verse_key":"2:89"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كِتَـٰبٌۭ","en_gloss":"a Book","transliteration":"kitābun","verse_key":"2:89"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:89"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عِندِ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿindi","verse_key":"2:89"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"2:89"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُصَدِّقٌۭ","en_gloss":"confirming","transliteration":"muṣaddiqun","verse_key":"2:89"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِّمَا","en_gloss":"what (was)","transliteration":"limā","verse_key":"2:89"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَعَهُمْ","en_gloss":"with them","transliteration":"maʿahum","verse_key":"2:89"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَكَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"though they used to","transliteration":"wakānū","verse_key":"2:89"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:89"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَبْلُ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qablu","verse_key":"2:89"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَسْتَفْتِحُونَ","en_gloss":"(that), pray for victory","transliteration":"yastaftiḥūna","verse_key":"2:89"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"2:89"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliterat