_gloss":"(91)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:91"}]},{"verse_key":"2:92","surah":2,"ayah":92,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَلَقَدْ جَآءَكُم مُّوسَىٰ بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ ثُمَّ ٱتَّخَذْتُمُ ٱلْعِجْلَ مِنۢ بَعْدِهِۦ وَأَنتُمْ ظَـٰلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Moses brought you clear signs, but then, while he was away, you chose to worship the calf- you did wrong.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"2:92"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَآءَكُم","en_gloss":"came to you","transliteration":"jāakum","verse_key":"2:92"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مُّوسَىٰ","en_gloss":"Musa","transliteration":"mūsā","verse_key":"2:92"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"with [the] clear signs","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","verse_key":"2:92"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"2:92"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱتَّخَذْتُمُ","en_gloss":"you took","transliteration":"ittakhadhtumu","verse_key":"2:92"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْعِجْلَ","en_gloss":"the calf","transliteration":"l-ʿij'la","verse_key":"2:92"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:92"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَعْدِهِۦ","en_gloss":"after him","transliteration":"baʿdihi","verse_key":"2:92"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَأَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"and you","transliteration":"wa-antum","verse_key":"2:92"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ظَـٰلِمُونَ","en_gloss":"(were) wrongdoers","transliteration":"ẓālimūna","verse_key":"2:92"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٩٢","en_gloss":"(92)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:92"}]},{"verse_key":"2:93","surah":2,"ayah":93,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ أَخَذْنَا مِيثَـٰقَكُمْ وَرَفَعْنَا فَوْقَكُمُ ٱلطُّورَ خُذُوا۟ مَآ ءَاتَيْنَـٰكُم بِقُوَّةٍ وَٱسْمَعُوا۟ ۖ قَالُوا۟ سَمِعْنَا وَعَصَيْنَا وَأُشْرِبُوا۟ فِى قُلُوبِهِمُ ٱلْعِجْلَ بِكُفْرِهِمْ ۚ قُلْ بِئْسَمَا يَأْمُرُكُم بِهِۦٓ إِيمَـٰنُكُمْ إِن كُنتُم مُّؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Remember when We took your pledge, making the mountain tower above you, and said, ‘Hold on firmly to what We have given you, and listen to [what We say].’ They said, ‘We hear and we disobey,’ and through their disbelief they were made to drink [the love of] the calf deep into their hearts. Say, ‘How evil are the things your belief commands you to do, if you really are believers!’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"2:93"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَخَذْنَا","en_gloss":"We took","transliteration":"akhadhnā","verse_key":"2:93"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِيثَـٰقَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your covenant","transliteration":"mīthāqakum","verse_key":"2:93"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَرَفَعْنَا","en_gloss":"and We raised","transliteration":"warafaʿnā","verse_key":"2:93"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَوْقَكُمُ","en_gloss":"over you","transliteration":"fawqakumu","verse_key":"2:93"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلطُّورَ","en_gloss":"the mount","transliteration":"l-ṭūra","verse_key":"2:93"},{"pos":7,"ar":"خُذُوا۟","en_gloss":"Hold","transliteration":"khudhū","verse_key":"2:93"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:93"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰكُم","en_gloss":"We gave you","transliteration":"ātaynākum","verse_key":"2:93"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِقُوَّةٍۢ","en_gloss":"with firmness","transliteration":"biquwwatin","verse_key":"2:93"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱسْمَعُوا۟ ۖ","en_gloss":"and listen","transliteration":"wa-is'maʿū","verse_key":"2:93"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"2:93"},{"pos":13,"ar":"سَمِعْنَا","en_gloss":"We heard","transliteration":"samiʿ'nā","verse_key":"2:93"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَعَصَيْنَا","en_gloss":"and we disobeyed","transliteration":"waʿaṣaynā","verse_key":"2:93"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَأُشْرِبُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they were made to drink","transliteration":"wa-ush'ribū","verse_key":"2:93"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:93"},{"pos":17,"ar":"قُلُوبِهِمُ","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbihimu","verse_key":"2:93"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱل